UseGPUReduction no
Useflag yes

NumberOfInitializationCycles 20000
NumberOfEquilibrationCycles  0
NumberOfProductionCycles     20000

NumberOfTrialPositions  8
NumberOfTrialOrientations   8

UseMaxStep  yes
MaxStepPerCycle 1
PrintEvery 200

UseChargesFromCIFFile yes

RestartFile no
RandomSeed  0

AdsorbateAllocateSpace 10240
NumberOfSimulations 1
SingleSimulation yes

DifferentFrameworks yes
InputFileType cif
FrameworkName calf20_ddec_super
UnitCells 0 1 1 1

ChargeMethod Ewald
Temperature 298
Pressure 113276.104

OverlapCriteria 1e5
CutOffVDW 12.8
CutOffCoulomb 12.8
EwaldPrecision 1e-6

UseDNNforHostGuest yes
DNNModelName Socket
DNNMethod Socket
DNNEnergyUnits eV
MaxDNNDrift 100000000

Component 0 MoleculeName             CO2
            TURN_OFF_CBMC_SWAP       yes
            IdealGasRosenbluthWeight 1.0
            FugacityCoefficient      PR-EOS
            TranslationProbability   1.0
            RotationProbability      1.0
            ReinsertionProbability   1.0
            SwapProbability          1.0
            CreateNumberOfMolecules  0


